  "prefLabel": "Env-A 802.07 Scheduling Changes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 802.07 Scheduling Changes.\n\n(a) The owner or operator shall notify the department by telephone, fax, or electronic mail prior to any proposed changes in the testing schedule for a compliance stack test or RATA.\n\n(b) The owner or operator shall obtain prior approval from the department, which shall be based on staff availability, of any new date for a compliance stack test or RATA.\n\nSource. #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
